[[FSE STAGE type=round width=10 depth=8 units=ft front=booth]]
[[FSE ENTITY booth type=mark pos=0,-4]]
[[FSE ENTITY wing type=entrance pos=-6,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY throne type=prop pos=0,3]]
[[FSE ENTITY crown type=prop on=throne]]
[[FSE ENTITY claudius type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY gertrude type=cast]]

# ACT ONE

## Scene 1

[[FSE ENTER claudius from=wing pos=0,2 facing=180]]

CLAUDIUS
Though yet of Hamlet our dear brother's death
The memory be green.

[[FSE EXIT all via=wing]]

## Scene 2

[[FSE STRIKE all;
      PRESET throne pos=0,4;
      PRESET claudius pos=0,3 facing=0,-5]]
[[FSE PRESET gertrude pos=1,3; PRESET crown with=gertrude]]

===

CLAUDIUS (V.O.)
How is it that the clouds still hang on you?

[[FSE STRIKE throne by=crew; SET gertrude facing=-90]]
[[FSE EXIT claudius via=wing]]
